# The three resonance waves: P1 sweeps from the sine through the resonance up to the top and down again on each,
# at C2 and C4 (k up to 32, limited to 6 kHz), then bends on resonance II (the pitch limit). Decay 0: the DCW
# is over within ~0.1 s, so P1 alone sets the distortion.
tempo 120
steps 48
tail 1.5
track lead
preset 0 182 0 0 255 30 0 0 128 0 128 200 0 128 100 255 0 0
note 0 C2 15 100
note 0 C4 15 100
sweep p1 0 255 0 8
sweep p1 255 0 8 15
param p2 219 16
note 16 C2 15 100
note 16 C4 15 100
sweep p1 0 255 16 24
sweep p1 255 0 24 31
param p2 255 32
param p1 255 32
note 32 C3 8 100
note 40 C2 8 100
param p2 219 40
bend 41 200
bend 42 -200
bend 43 200
expect sound 0 48
expect idle 58
expect peak_below -3
